{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30373","headline":"广陵答崔琛 · 赵嘏","name":"广陵答崔琛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"棹倚隋家旧院墙，柳金梅雪扑檐香。\n朱楼映日重重晚，碧水含光灩灩长。\n八斗已闻传姓字，一枝何足计行藏。\n声名官职应前定，且把旌麾入醉乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}